                                "sense_id": "82a6dda7-9e23-39ce-aa66-22767006fe23",
                                "text": "My mom likes to listen to old crooners like Frank Sinatra and Tommy Dorsey."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6326bcfb-0fc2-4c3e-bcda-74003cf5dc36",
                                "sense_id": "82a6dda7-9e23-39ce-aa66-22767006fe23",
                                "text": "“But, you know, crooners gonna croon.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fd668980-e479-413c-8355-ffc28d9a5be9",
                                "sense_id": "82a6dda7-9e23-39ce-aa66-22767006fe23",
                                "text": "“Curious.” “Ah, don't waste those big Vulcan brain juices, T'Lyn. He's just a novelty beach crooner.” “Krog is my favorite musician.” “Oh. Sorry. I-I've heard he's very, uh, tropical.” “He is a master of the Vibe Tubes.”"
                            }
                        ]
